{
    "title": "Blinkist: Book Summaries Daily",
    "description": "Join over 32 million users who love Blinkist\u2019s book summaries for fast learning and personal growth.\r\n\r\nImagine getting the key insights from 7,500+ bestselling books and top podcasts in just 15 minutes. Yep, it\u2019s possible.\r\n\r\nWhether you're aiming to boost your career, work on personal growth, or simply stay curious, Blinkist makes learning easy and fun, even with your busy schedule.\r\n\r\nGet started today and see why millions trust Blinkist to learn faster.\r\n\r\n<b>What You Get with Blinkist</b>\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udcda <b>7,500+ book summaries packed with brilliant ideas</b>\r\n\r\nNo more overwhelming reading lists! Blinkist gives you the best bits from nonfiction and fiction books in just 15 minutes. Read or listen\u2014whichever works best for you.\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udfa7 <b>Audio and text summaries for learning on the go</b>\r\n\r\nBusy? No problem. Blinkist lets you listen to book summaries while commuting, exercising, or even folding laundry. Multitasking for the win!\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udfaf <b>Personalized learning paths</b>\r\n\r\nSet your goals, and we\u2019ll create custom recommendations to help you hit them. Whether it\u2019s self-improvement, business skills, or science, we\u2019ve got you covered with expert-curated collections.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\ude80 <b>Blinkist Pro with Blinkist AI\u2014the ultimate learning hack</b>\r\n\r\nWant to go beyond books? With Blinkist Pro, you can summarize articles, PDFs, and videos in just seconds with Blinkist AI. Yep, it\u2019s a learning revolution, and you\u2019re invited.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udcc5 <b>Daily inspiration at your fingertips</b>\r\n\r\nStart your day with bite-sized wisdom through daily quotes and insights. Perfect for daily microlearning and keeping yourself inspired.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udcdd <b>Expert-led audio Guides</b>\r\n\r\nNeed more than just summaries? Blinkist\u2019s Guides dive deeper into today\u2019s hottest topics like leadership, mindfulness, personal growth and more. Your time is valuable\u2014we get that.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udcf6 <b>Offline learning</b>\r\n\r\nNo Wi-Fi? No worries! Download summaries and keep learning wherever you are.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f <b>Send-to-Kindle feature</b>\r\n\r\nPrefer reading on your Kindle? We\u2019ve got you! Send summaries directly to your device for a smooth reading experience.\r\n\r\n<b>Why You\u2019ll Love Blinkist</b>\r\n\u26a1 Quick, flexible learning\u2014perfect for busy lives\r\n\ud83d\udcd6 Massive library\u2014find everything you need to grow\r\n\ud83c\udfa7 Audio versions\u2014learn while you do other things\r\n\ud83d\udca1 Makes learning fun\u2014without the information overload\r\n\r\n<b>What the Press is Saying</b>\r\n\r\n\"Blinkist is the perfect app to help you learn more and do more in less time.\" \u2014 The New York Times\r\n\u201cBlinkist makes learning so convenient, you can squeeze it in anytime.\u201d \u2014 TheNextWeb\r\n\u201cAn essential tool for curious minds who are short on time.\u201d \u2014 Forbes\r\n\"The audio feature is a game-changer for learning while multitasking.\" \u2014 BuzzFeed\r\n\r\n<b>Let\u2019s Get You Started!</b>\r\nDownload Blinkist now and enjoy a FREE 7-day trial with unlimited access to all features:\r\n\ud83d\udcda 7,500+ book summaries from bestselling nonfiction and fiction books\r\n\ud83c\udfa7 Audio versions for learning on the go\r\n\ud83c\udfaf Personalized recommendations based on your goals\r\n\ud83d\ude80 Blinkist AI to summarize articles, PDFs, and videos instantly\r\n\ud83d\udcc5 Daily inspiration with quotes and bite-sized insights\r\n\ud83d\udcdd Expert-led Guides to dive deeper into key topics\r\n\ud83d\udcf6 Offline mode to learn anywhere, anytime\r\n\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f Send-to-Kindle feature for seamless reading\r\n2\ufe0f\u20e3 Two accounts in one with the Premium 2-for-1 offer\r\nQuestions? Suggestions? Speak to a real person at Blinkist! Our trusty customer support team is just an email away\u2014simply write to support@blinkist.com",
    "descriptionHTML": "Join over 32 million users who love Blinkist\u2019s book summaries for fast learning and personal growth.<br><br>Imagine getting the key insights from 7,500+ bestselling books and top podcasts in just 15 minutes. Yep, it\u2019s possible.<br><br>Whether you&#39;re aiming to boost your career, work on personal growth, or simply stay curious, Blinkist makes learning easy and fun, even with your busy schedule.<br><br>Get started today and see why millions trust Blinkist to learn faster.<br><br><b>What You Get with Blinkist</b><br><br>\ud83d\udcda <b>7,500+ book summaries packed with brilliant ideas</b><br><br>No more overwhelming reading lists! Blinkist gives you the best bits from nonfiction and fiction books in just 15 minutes. Read or listen\u2014whichever works best for you.<br><br>\ud83c\udfa7 <b>Audio and text summaries for learning on the go</b><br><br>Busy? No problem. Blinkist lets you listen to book summaries while commuting, exercising, or even folding laundry. Multitasking for the win!<br><br>\ud83c\udfaf <b>Personalized learning paths</b><br><br>Set your goals, and we\u2019ll create custom recommendations to help you hit them. Whether it\u2019s self-improvement, business skills, or science, we\u2019ve got you covered with expert-curated collections.<br><br>\ud83d\ude80 <b>Blinkist Pro with Blinkist AI\u2014the ultimate learning hack</b><br><br>Want to go beyond books? With Blinkist Pro, you can summarize articles, PDFs, and videos in just seconds with Blinkist AI. Yep, it\u2019s a learning revolution, and you\u2019re invited.<br><br>\ud83d\udcc5 <b>Daily inspiration at your fingertips</b><br><br>Start your day with bite-sized wisdom through daily quotes and insights. Perfect for daily microlearning and keeping yourself inspired.<br><br>\ud83d\udcdd <b>Expert-led audio Guides</b><br><br>Need more than just summaries? Blinkist\u2019s Guides dive deeper into today\u2019s hottest topics like leadership, mindfulness, personal growth and m